    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/cdf53b0f17060f57543d729e892df978.poster.avif?t=1707756234\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/cdf53b0f17060f57543d729e892df978.webm?t=1707756234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/cdf53b0f17060f57543d729e892df978.mp4?t=1707756234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Mini Star Imposters is a game where you have to find and kill all 4 Imposters hiding among 16 others within the time limit.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/91771c9a6cce47a05d8e80f65d7fd9cc.poster.avif?t=1707756234\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/91771c9a6cce47a05d8e80f65d7fd9cc.webm?t=1707756234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/91771c9a6cce47a05d8e80f65d7fd9cc.mp4?t=1707756234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your intuition, memory, and luck to find and kill the 4 Imposters.<br>And be careful not to kill the innocent.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/be99c19cd5b7f9f7f7b405050195c606.poster.avif?t=1707756234\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/be99c19cd5b7f9f7f7b405050195c606.webm?t=1707756234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/be99c19cd5b7f9f7f7b405050195c606.mp4?t=1707756234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Remember the random cards you are dealt at the start and use them to your advantage.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/12fc22c9a6d62f82c812a7fa6c869e15.poster.avif?t=1707756234\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/12fc22c9a6d62f82c812a7fa6c869e15.webm?t=1707756234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757990/extras/12fc22c9a6d62f82c812a7fa6c869e15.mp4?t=1707756234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Be careful, the Imposters can be very stupid, but they can also be very smart.<br>And they make the most of the cards they are dealt.",
